{"id":395756243,"author":{"login":"themez","id":1323793,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMjM3OTM=","gravatar_id":"","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOJF_VYs4XlsLT","tag_name":"v1.23.5","target_commitish":"main","name":"v1.23.5","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-09-24T14:08:30Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T14:09:30Z","published_at":"2026-09-24T14:09:30Z","assets":[],"body":"## v1.23.5 - 2026.09.24\n\n### Downloads\n\n- [macOS (Apple Silicon)](https://download.chatboxai.app/releases/Chatbox-1.23.5-arm64.dmg)\n- [macOS (Intel)](https://download.chatboxai.app/releases/Chatbox-1.23.5.dmg)\n- [Windows (x64)](https://download.chatboxai.app/releases/Chatbox-1.23.5-Setup.exe)\n- [Linux (x64 DEB)](https://download.chatboxai.app/releases/Chatbox-1.23.5-amd64.deb)\n- [Linux (ARM64 DEB)](https://download.chatboxai.app/releases/Chatbox-1.23.5-arm64.deb)\n\n### What’s Changed\n\n1. Fixed external one-click MCP setup links failing to open the prefilled server dialog when the app was not running\n2. You can now edit the last output of a Work Mode reply\n3. Fixed Image Creator history going blank or failing to finish loading when a record is incomplete\n4. Fixed undoing a new topic sometimes deleting the previous conversation\n5. Fixed leftover digits in the message input after pasting during nine-key typing\n\n### 更新说明\n\n1. 修复应用未启动时，通过外部链接一键添加 MCP 服务无法打开预填配置窗口的问题\n2. 工作模式的助手回复现在可以编辑最后一段输出\n3. 修复图片创作历史记录不完整时页面白屏或无法继续加载的问题\n4. 修复新建话题后撤销会误删原来聊天记录的问题\n5. 修复九键输入过程中粘贴后输入框出现一串数字的问题\n"}
